   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:53,878:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: PART 2: OUR SOLUTION
   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:53,880:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: One-Line Pitch
   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:53,884:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:54,076:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: We built a TWO-LAYER early warning system on Databricks. Layer 1: ML predicts which students
   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:54,184:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: will drop out and proves the model is fair. Layer 2: Our AI voice agent calls flagged students with
   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:54,238:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: non-leading questions, validates the prediction, identifies the ROOT CAUSE, and connects them to
   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:54,258:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: the exact resource they need — an NGO for financial aid, a loan scheme, a counselor, a career mentor.
   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:54,283:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: No false alarms. No bias. Just the right help at the right time.
   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:54,286:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
