   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:54,333:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:54,335:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     │  2. SILVER LAYER — Clean + Feature Engineering          │
   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:54,337:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     │     • Target: Dropout=1, Enrolled/Graduate=0 (binary)   │
   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:54,341:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     │     • Clean nulls, cast types, validate ranges          │
   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:54,345:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     │     • ENGINEERED FEATURES (our creativity):             │
   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:54,349:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     │       ─ grade_trajectory: slope of Sem1→Sem2 grades     │
   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:54,355:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     │       ─ financial_stress_index: tuition + debtor +      │
   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:54,358:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     │         scholarship + GDP + inflation (composite)       │
   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:54,362:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     │       ─ semester_grade_delta: Sem2 - Sem1 per subject   │
   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:54,366:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     │       ─ curricular_engagement: approved/enrolled ratio  │
   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:54,370:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     │       ─ age_risk_flag: mature student indicator         │
   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:54,372:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     │       ─ economic_pressure: unemployment + inflation     │
   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:54,373:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     └──────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────┘
