   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:56,104:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Layer 2 Fusion: ML Score + Voice Validation
   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:56,106:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Final Score = 0.6 × ML_risk_score + 0.4 × Voice_dropout_intent_score
   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:56,108:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Why 60-40?
