   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:56,113:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:   • Voice captures CURRENT intent and emotional state → 40%
   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:56,115:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:   • Together: historical pattern + present reality = maximum accuracy
   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:56,116:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Scenarios:
