   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:57,488:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: PART 11: THE PITCH SCRIPT
   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:57,491:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 30-Second Elevator Pitch
   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:57,493:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:57,567:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Universities lose 7 million students to dropout every year in India. The warning signs are scattered
   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:57,594:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: across 3 departments that never talk to each other. We built The Dropout Signal: a TWO-LAYER
   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:57,599:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: system on Databricks. Layer 1 predicts risk from grades, fees, and demographics — and mathematically
   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:57,600:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: PROVES it
   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:57,601:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: '
   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:57,710:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: s fair. Layer 2 is our innovation: an AI voice agent calls flagged students with
   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:57,796:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: non-leading questions, confirms the prediction, identifies the ROOT CAUSE, and connects them to
   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:57,825:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: the exact help they need — an NGO for aid, a loan scheme, a counselor. No false alarms. No bias. 70
   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:57,829:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: students saved per semester. ₹2.8 crore recovered.
   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:57,831:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
