   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:58,032:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Student
   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:58,038:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: #2847: ML says 87% risk. But is it real? Our AI CALLS them. Five non-leading questions. Student says: 
