   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:58,102:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: financial. System auto-recommends: National Scholarship Portal, Vidyalakshmi loan, Pratham Foundation. The
   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:58,106:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: counselor doesn
   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:58,109:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: '
   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:58,114:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: t just know WHO is at risk — they know WHY and exactly WHERE to send them.
   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:58,118:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:58,123:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  | Final Gold table
   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:58,127:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: with resource mapping |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:58,130:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
