   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:59,344:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: s Standard choice with
   DEBUG: 2026-04-11 12:41:59,349:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Advanced execution.
